{"id":31,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It pacifies offspring by placing them in the gaps between the spines on its back. The spines will never secrete poison while young are present."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Nidoqueen is better at defense than offense. With scales like armor, this Pokémon will shield its children from any kind of attack."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Tough scales cover the sturdy body of this Pokémon. It appears that the scales grow in cycles."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Nidoqueen’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This Pokémon is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"The body is covered by stiff, needlelike scales. If it becomes excited, the needles bristle outwards."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It uses its scaly, rugged body to seal the entrance of its nest and protect its young from predators."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Its body is covered with needle-like scales. It never shows signs of shrinking from any attack."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Its hard scales provide strong protection. It uses its hefty bulk to execute powerful moves."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles using its tough, scaly body. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The hard scales that cover its strong body serve as excellent protection from any attack."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Poison Point","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may poison the attacker."},{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's competitiv